msgstr "她的简称。文字头像也取自这里。"

#: src/features/setup/persona-step.tsx
msgid "What should she call you?"
msgstr "她该怎么称呼你？"

#: src/features/jobs/detail.tsx
msgid "What the command printed. Its end usually says why a job stopped."
msgstr "命令输出的内容。末尾通常会说明任务为什么停止。"

#: src/features/studio/knowledge-section.tsx
msgid "What the index jobs read: which of her fact files, the pattern that names her in them, and the scene types left out of her stream archive. Index again after a change."
msgstr "索引任务读取的内容：她的哪些资料文件、资料里指代她的规则，以及直播回放中不收录的场景类型。修改后请重新索引。"

#: src/features/jobs/detail.tsx
msgid "What the job reported, newest at the bottom."
msgstr "任务报告的内容，最新的在最下面。"

#: src/features/studio/video-table.tsx
msgid "When was it streamed?"
msgstr "这场直播是哪天？"

#: src/components/settings-form/labels.ts
msgid "Where calls and jobs record what they spend. Default usage.db in the data home."
msgstr "通话和任务记录花费的位置。默认为数据目录中的 usage.db。"

#: src/features/studio/videos-section.tsx
msgid "Where each video stands by the latest plan, and what the running job is doing."
msgstr "按最近一次规划显示每个视频的进度，以及正在运行的任务在做什么。"

#: src/components/settings-form/labels.ts
msgid "Whether she answers in text or with a voice message. Auto lets the director choose voice when a line suits it, more often after a voice message of yours. A chat's own reply mode overrides hers, and without a key for her voice she answers in text."
msgstr "她用文字还是语音消息回复。选「自动」时由调度器判断哪句话适合用语音，你发过语音后更常这样。聊天自己的回复方式优先于她的设置；她的声音没有密钥时，她会用文字回复。"

#: src/features/studio/voice-section.tsx
msgid "Which provider and model read her lines."
msgstr "由哪个服务商的哪个模型朗读她的台词。"

#: src/features/studio/models-section.tsx
msgid "Who hears you and who thinks for her: a provider and a model each. She speaks with the voice set under <0>Voice</0>."
msgstr "由谁听你说话、由谁替她思考：各选一个服务商和模型。她说话用的声音在「<0>声音</0>」中设置。"

#: src/features/setup/keys-step.tsx
msgid "Who Hears, Thinks and Speaks"
msgstr "由谁来听、思考和说话"

#: src/features/studio/identity-section.tsx
msgid "Who she is, as the built-in prompts and the call page name her. Write the names in her language."
msgstr "她是谁：内置提示词和通话页面会这样称呼她。名字请用她的语言填写。"

#: src/features/setup/persona-fields.tsx
msgid "Who she is, in one English sentence. It tells the knowledge search which questions are about her."
msgstr "用一句英文介绍她是谁。知识检索据此判断哪些问题是在问她。"

#: src/features/setup/persona-step.tsx
msgid "Who will you talk to?"
msgstr "你想和谁聊天？"

#: src/features/setup/stepper.tsx
msgid "Who you'll talk to"
msgstr "你的聊天对象"

#: src/features/chats/why-answered.tsx
msgid "Why {name} Answered"
msgstr "{name}为什么回答"

#: src/features/setup/memory-step.tsx
msgid "With memory on, she remembers you from one call to the next. It needs Qdrant, a database you run in Docker on this machine. Skip it and everything else still works."
msgstr "开启记忆后，她会在多次通话之间记得你。这需要在本机用 Docker 运行 Qdrant 数据库。跳过也不影响其他功能。"

#: src/features/jobs/labels.ts
msgid "Works out what the video pipeline would do and what it would cost, without running it."
msgstr "估算视频流水线会做什么、要花多少钱，但不会真正运行。"

